          %h1#ordinary_euclidean_manifolds_as_euclidean_supermanifolds ordinary Euclidean manifolds as Euclidean supermanifolds
          %p
            Specifically in 2-dimensions, an ordinary Spin-Eulidean manifold is one with
            = succeed "-structure." do
