                  %mo →
                  %mi G
                  %mo ′
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G \to G'
            and with respect to that a
          %p
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
              %semantics
